<h2 id="equations">Equations</h2>

<p>Inline math works with double dollar signs, such as the Boltzmann factor \(\exp(-U(x) / k_B T)\), and display equations sit on their own lines:</p>

\[p(x) = \frac{1}{Z} \exp\!\left(-\frac{U(x)}{k_B T}\right)\]

<h2 id="code-blocks">Code blocks</h2>

<div class="language-python highlighter-rouge"><div class="highlight"><pre class="highlight"><code><span class="kn">import</span> <span class="nn">numpy</span> <span class="k">as</span> <span class="n">np</span>

<span class="k">def</span> <span class="nf">rmsd</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">a</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">):</span>
    <span class="s">"""Root-mean-square deviation between two coordinate arrays."""</span>
    <span class="k">return</span> <span class="n">np</span><span class="p">.</span><span class="n">sqrt</span><span class="p">(((</span><span class="n">a</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="n">b</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="o">**</span> <span class="mi">2</span><span class="p">).</span><span class="nb">sum</span><span class="p">(</span><span class="n">axis</span><span class="o">=-</span><span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">).</span><span class="n">mean</span><span class="p">())</span>
</code></pre></div></div>

<p>Once real notes are ready, this test post can be deleted or replaced in <code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">blog/_posts/</code>.</p>]]></content><author><name>Kabindra Sony</name></author><category term="blog" /><summary type="html"><![CDATA[This is a placeholder post to test the layout, typography, math rendering, and code blocks while setting up the website.]]></summary><media:thumbnail xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" url="https://thisizkavi-lab.github.io/kavi-web/assets/img/profile.jpg" /><media:content medium="image" url="https://thisizkavi-lab.github.io/kavi-web/assets/img/profile.jpg" xmlns:media="http://search.yahoo.com/mrss/" /></entry><entry><title type="html">Testing the talks section</title><link href="https://thisizkavi-lab.github.io/kavi-web/talks/testing-talks/" rel="alternate" type="text/html" title="Testing the talks section" /><published>2026-10-16T00:00:00+00:00</published><updated>2026-10-16T00:00:00+00:00</updated><id>https://thisizkavi-lab.github.io/kavi-web/talks/testing-talks</id><content type="html" xml:base="https://thisizkavi-lab.github.io/kavi-web/talks/testing-talks/"><![CDATA[<p>This is a dummy entry to test how the <strong>Talks</strong> section (“Out loud.”) looks on the live website.</p>

